{
 "priority": 2,
 "source_bins": [
  "sound_auth.bin",
  "talk.bin"
 ],
 "strings": {
  "Objection!\nThe defense is leading the witness.": "",
  "Objection!\nCouncil is leading the witness.": "",
  "Sustained.\nPlease rephrase the question.": "",
  "Shono-san. Can you say without a doubt that Waku-san\nwas in that bed when you checked on him?": "",
  "Can you say beyond a reasonable doubt\nthat Waku-san was in that bed?": "",
  "I... don't think I can, no.": "",
  "I'm afraid I... can't say for sure.": "",
  "Then the defense rests.": "",
  "But, I do have a quick remark\nfor the prosecution.": "",
  "But I'd like to address the prosecution,\nif you don't mind.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(The prosecution's argument has fallen apart.\nNow to go in for the kill!)</color>": "",
  "The charges against my client stem from your assertion\nthat he's the only possible suspect...": "",
  "Charges were brought against my client based\non the assumption of a given timeframe.": "",
  "Assuming the crime took place\nwithin the stated time frame.": "",
  "The defendant was considered\nthe only possible suspect.": "",
  "However, the defense has proven without a doubt that Shono-san's\ntestimony is unreliable, establishing reasonable doubt for my client.": "",
  "However, Shono-san's testimony has been proven unreliable,\nmeaning that another person could have committed the crime.": "",
  "I would suggest, then...": "",
  "Therefore...": "",
  "That you withdraw the charges\nagainst my client.": "",
  "I suggest you drop the charges.": "",
  "With such inconclusive evidence,\nyou'll only be wasting the court's precious time.": "",
  "With such inconclusive evidence,\nyou'll only waste the court's time if you proceed.": "",
  "The prosecution does not consider\nthe witness's testimony inconclusive.": "",
  "His memory of the incident may be fuzzy, yes,\nbut that doesn't change that he saw the victim.": "",
  "His memory may be fuzzy, yes,\nbut that doesn't change that he saw the victim.": "",
  "So your whole case\nis based on a \"fuzzy\" memory?": "",
  "Is a \"fuzzy memory\" accurate enough\nfor testimony?": "",
  "This promising young man's future is at stake, and you're\nwilling to throw that away on unreliable testimony?": "",
  "Are you sure you can completely trust the witness,\nwith this young man's promising future at stake?": "",
  "Dr. Shono is a bright\nand diligent researcher.": "",
  "The witness, Dr. Shono,\nis a devoted researcher.": "",
  "After watching his own grandmother develop dementia,\nhe vowed to create a drug that could cure the disease.": "",
  "After watching his own grandmother develop dementia,\nhe vowed to create a cure.": "",
  "After paying his own way through medical school,\nhe went on to become the head researcher at the ADDC.": "",
  "He paid his own way through medical school\nand went on to become the ADDC's head researcher.": "",
  "Day after day, Dr. Shono visits his sick\npatients out of the kindness of his heart.": "",
  "Day after day, Dr. Shono visits his patients\nout of the kindness of his heart.": "",
  "Leading to his valiant testimony here today.": "",
  "Leading to the testimony we heard today.": "",
  "If you want to know whether I trust this man,\nthen my answer is a resounding yes!": "",
  "If you want to know whether I trust this man,\nthen my answer is a resounding yes.": "",
  "In other words, because he's such a great researcher, his testimony\nis infallible? His own admission that he's not sure is somehow overlooked?": "",
  "So what you're saying is that no matter his claims,\nthe prosecution believes him with blind faith.": "",
  "Is that the sum of it?": "",
  "Does that sum it up?": "",
  "Because from here, it sounds like you're putting\nyour faith in Shono-san's title, not his testimony today.": "",
  "If you ask me, it sounds like you're putting your faith\nin Shono-san's title, not his testimony.": "",
  "The prosecution is not as easily\nswayed as you think!": "",
  "The prosecution would not be swayed\nby something so petty.": "",
  "And you want to talk reputation,\nwhat of your client's history of domestic abuse?": "",
  "Moreover... the courtroom judges all equally,\neven a defendant with a history of domestic abuse. ": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Uh oh. He's gonna bring up Okubo's record...)</color>": "",
  "Six years ago, the defendant broke his girlfriend's finger.\nThe poor girl is still suffering from the effects.": "",
  "And the cause?\nA minor drunken disagreement.": "",
  "And the cause?\nNothing more than a minor drunken disagreement.": "",
  "Now, fast forward to what occurred\na few days prior to the crime.": "",
  "Now, let us revisit the days\nbefore this murder.": "",
  "Waku-san, suspecting the defendant of stealing his wallet,\nlashed out and punched the defendant in the face.": "",
  "Waku-san suspected the defendant of stealing his wallet.\nHe lashed out and punched him.": "",
  "Given the clearly violent nature of Okubo-san here,\nthat alone would be motivation enough to murder the poor old...": "",
  "In this case, given the defendant's violent nature,\nthat would surely be motive enough for killing the... Uh..": "",
  "Is something wrong, ma'am?\nPlease remain seated while court is in session.": "",
  "Is something wrong?\nPlease be seated while court is in session.": "",
  "No, it's nothing, Vice Minister.": "",
  "No, nothing to worry about,\nVice Minister.": "",
  "I haven't seen you in about three years,\nKido-san. I see you're still the director.": "",
  "It's been three years, Kido-san.\nI see you're still the ADDC's director.": "",
  "You look familiar, but I can't quite place the name.\nI seem to recall you looking sharper.": "",
  "You do look familiar, yes.\nThough... perhaps a little worse for wear.": "",
  "I'm a detective based in Kamurocho now.": "",
  "These days, I'm a detective\nbased in Kamurocho.": "",
  "The name's Yagami.": "",
  "I remember now. You're the reason\nTerasawa-kun's no longer with us.": "",
  "Remember, Shono?": "",
  "Isn't that right, Shono?": "",
  "Okubo-san was unstoppable.\nIf only my testimony had been better...": "",
  "Shono-san, right?": "",
  "Is that you, Shono-san?": "",
  "Does it matter?\nWhat brings you here anyway?": "",
  "That aside.\nWhat brings you here today?": "",
  "I'm investigating a murder.": "",
  "And I'll need your cooperation with it.\nJust like old times.": "",
  "One I'll need your cooperation on.\nJust like old times.": "",
  "Yes, I see. Yes. Thank you.": "",
  "Yes. I see.\nI understand... Thank you.": "",
  "The same Shono-san you were just with?": "",
  "Wait, the same Shono-san?": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Why would Shintani call Shono?)</color>": "",
  "Yes. However, it's unclear as to what the point\nof the call was meant to be.": "",
  "Yes. However, it's unclear as to what\nthe point of the call was.": "",
  "Shono was away from his desk at the time, you see,\nand Shintani-san didn't leave a message.": "",
  "You have no idea what he wanted to talk about?": "",
  "So you have no idea\nwhat he wanted?": "",
  "None. Shono says he doesn't know a Shintani-san,\nand sees no reason why he would be calling.": "",
  "Oh really.": "",
  "Then why?": "",
  "Shono and I co-authored the research paper on AD-9.\nWe're quite well-known, as it turns out.": "",
  "Sometimes complete strangers pretend to be close friends\nor relatives in order to contact us.": "",
  "Sometimes, complete strangers pretend to be\nclose friends or relatives in order to contact us.": "",
  "Perhaps Shintani-san fell into that category?": "",
  "Perhaps Shintani-san\nfell into that category.": "",
  "Have you heard of the Mole murders taking place\nin Kamurocho, Dr. Kido?": "",
  "The guy we think is behind Shintani's murder\nis a serial killer in Kamurocho called the Mole.": "",
  "Three yakuza, each one with their eyes gouged out.\nIt's a grisly business.": "",
  "So far, he's killed three.\nYakuza, with eyes gouged out.": "",
  "Shintani was killed in the same way.": "",
  "Does that sound familiar at all?": "",
  "I've seen the news.": "",
  "Can you think of anything\ntying the ADDC to those murders?": "",
  "Can you think of anything\ntying the ADDC to the Mole's murders?": "",
  "Huh? Look, just what are you implying!?": "",
  "Huh? What exactly are you implying?": "",
  "I believe we're done here.\nThere's nothing I can help you with.": "",
  "I believe we're done here.\nThere is nothing more I can help you with.": "",
  "Please, stop!\nYou can't!": "",
  "Ah... Please, stop!\nYou can't!": "",
  "Detective Kuroiwa.\nKamuro Police, Organized Crime.": "",
  "The name's Kuroiwa.\nKamuro Police, Organized Crime.": "",
  "One of your guests here has information related\nto the case I'm currently investigating.": "",
  "Today, I'm here for one of your guests.\nHe's related to my current case.": "",
  "That would be you, Yagami.": "",
  "That'd be you, Yagami.": "",
  "I'd like to speak to you as a material witness\nto the murder of the lawyer, Masamichi Shintani.": "",
  "I'd like to speak to you as a material witness\nto the murder of Masamichi Shintani.": "",
  "I'm Hoshino,\nan attorney at Genda Law Office.": "",
  "I'm Hoshino,\nfrom the Genda Law Office.": "",
  "Officer, is this interview voluntary, or?": "",
  "Detective...\nMay I assume this interview is voluntary?": "",
  "...It is.": "",
  "It's your call, Yagami-san.": "",
  "Yagami-san?\nWhat's your call?": "",
  "I think I'll pass.": "",
  "I'll pass.": "",
  "You have your answer, sir.\nYou can go now.": "",
  "You have your answer, sir.\nNow please leave.": "",
  "You can make this easier if you come now.\nNext time it won't be voluntary.": "",
  "You're better off coming with me now, let me tell you.\nThis won't be voluntary next time.": "",
  "Your empty threats don't\nmean much to a lawyer.": "",
  "Threaten all you like,\nbut Yagami-san knows the law.": "",
  "Can you take this elsewhere?\nI really must be—": "",
  "Excuse me, can you take this somewhere else?\nI really must be—": "",
  "Too bad he's not a lawyer\nanymore then.": "",
  "Good thing he's not a lawyer anymore.": "",
  "Your friend's nothing now.": "",
  "Just come along quietly. I'll come back\nwith a warrant if I have to.": "",
  "Just come along quietly.\nIf I have to, I'll be more than happy to get a warrant.": "",
  "I'd like to see you try.": "",
  "Why do you suspect me, anyway?\nI bet you don't even have a reason.": "",
  "Why do you suspect me?\nDo you even have a reason?": "",
  "I can come up with a few good ones.": "",
  "I can always make one.": "",
  "Enough!\nGet the hell out of my office!": "",
  "You'll regret this, Yagami.": "",
  "You'll regret this.": "",
  "Kuroiwa-san!": "",
  "Kuroiwa-san.": "",
  "You too. Out!": "",
  "That includes you two.": "",
  "Before we go, can we speak\nto Shono-san for a sec?": "",
  "One thing first. Any chance we could\nstill talk to Shono-san?": "",
  "We need to know why\nShintani called him.": "",
  "We need to know why Shintani called him.\nThat's all.": "",
  "Listen, I already told you, he doesn't know.\nGet it through your skull.": "",
  "I already told you, Shono doesn't know!\nDo you understand?": "",
  "Now. Please leave.": "",
  "Now please leave.": "",
  "No problem.\nWe'll let you get back to work.": "",
  "I get it.\nWe'll let you get back to your work.": "",
  "This is really getting out\nof hand, don't you think?": "",
  "All this is... starting to\nget out of hand.": "",
  "I can't believe that detective\nthinks you're a material witness.": "",
  "You hear that detective? I can't believe he said\nyou're a material witness, Yagami-san.": "",
  "Yeah, I dunno what\nhe's talking about.": "",
  "Yeah. I dunno what he's\ntalking about.": "",
  "But what I'm more interested in\nis how he even knew where to find me.": "",
  "That aside, what I'm more interested in is\nhow he even knew where to find me.": "",
  "That's a good point.\nHow would the police know we were here?": "",
  "Good point. How would the police\nknow we were here?": "",
  "No clue.": "",
  "For now let's focus on Shono, though. It would be\na waste coming here and not talking to him.": "",
  "For now, let's focus on Shono.\nIt'd be a waste, coming here and not talking to him.": "",
  "Agreed. Let's see if the\nreceptionist can help us.": "",
  "Agreed.\nLet's see if the receptionist can help us.": "",
  "Can I help you?": "",
  "Welcome, sir.": "",
  "Actually, I've already been here.\nI was just with Director Kido, remember?": "",
  "Actually, I was just here asking\nabout the Director...": "",
  "Oh, of course!\nDid you forget something, sir?": "",
  "Not exactly. I'd actually like to speak\nto Shono-san, the AD-9 researcher.": "",
  "Well, I've got another question. I'd like to speak to\nShono-san, the AD-9 researcher.": "",
  "Where would I be able to find him?": "",
  "Let me see, that should be the research wing.\nI believe he's in the protein abnormalities lab.": "",
  "Let me see... That should be the research wing.\nI believe he's in the protein abnormalities lab.": "",
  "Probably need a gold keycard\nto get in there, huh?": "",
  "That's correct, sir. I should be able to lend\nyou one with the director's approval, though.": "",
  "Yes. But I should be able to lend you one\nwith the director's approval.": "",
  "Just give me a moment to ask.\nCould you tell me your name, sir?": "",
  "Actually, uh... never mind.\nKido-san seemed pretty busy earlier.": "",
  "Uh, actually... never mind.\nKido-san seemed pretty busy earlier.": "",
  "I'll try back later.": "",
  "I'll come back later.": "",
  "Are you sure, sir...?": "",
  "Are you sure...?": "",
  "Good call. There's no chance\nKido-san would let us in.": "",
  "There's no way he's\ngonna let us through.": "",
  "At least now we know where Shono is.": "",
  "Still, at least we know where Shono is.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(The research wing.)</color>": "",
  "Yeah. I wonder if there's a map\naround here somewhere...": "",
  "Yeah.\nIs there a map around here...?": "",
  "This is where we are now.\nThe ADDC lobby.": "",
  "Here's where we are right now.\nThe Center's main lobby.": "",
  "This goes over to the hospital.\nI think Waku-san was up on the 4th floor.": "",
  "The service entrance parking lot. All the delivery\npeople come in and out through here.": "",
  "A service parking lot... or the entrance to it, anyway.\nAll delivery people come in and out through here.": "",
  "This is where Okubo's truck\nwas parked three years ago.": "",
  "Director Kido's office.\nWe were just in there.": "",
  "The Director's office.\nWe were just in there to see Kido.": "",
  "This leads to the research wing.": "",
  "The research wing... There.": "",
  "The receptionist said he would be\nin the protein abnormalities lab, right?": "",
  "According to the receptionist, he'll be in\nthe protein abnormalities lab, right?": "",
  "Huh. Well, I guess that's not on this map.": "",
  "From the looks of it,\nthat's not marked on this map.": "",
  "The research wing.\nShould be able to find Shono here.": "",
  "The research wing.\nSounds like Shono works in that building.": "",
  "Some kinda security gate, huh?\nThe research wing must be just past there.": "",
  "A security gate...?\nThe research wing must be just past there.": "",
  "(I need to figure out where the research wing is\nand how to get there.)": "",
  "Um, excuse me.": "",
  "Ah... Excuse me.": "",
  "Yes, ma'am?": "",
  "This is one of Shono-san's researchers.\nShe was just about to return to the lab.": "",
  "Oh?": "",
  "My name's Hashimoto. I can show you\ninto Dr. Shono's lab if you'd like.": "",
  "My name's Hashimoto.\nI can show you to Dr. Shono's lab if you'd like.": "",
  "Great, we'll take you up on that.": "",
  "We'll take you up on that.": "",
  "Wonderful. Hashimoto-san just happened\nto be passing through.": "",
  "Wonderful. Lucky for you Hashimoto-san\nwas passing through.": "",
  "I really appreciate this,\nHashimoto-san. I'm Yagami.": "",
  "I really appreciate this.\nThe name's Yagami.": "",
  "And I'm Hoshino, from the Genda Law Office.": "",
  "And I'm Hoshino from the\nGenda Law Office.": "",
  "Thank you for doing this.": "",
  "Oh, don't mention it. I'm glad to help\na guest of Director Kido's.": "",
  "Of course. I'm glad to help\na guest of the Director's.": "",
  "This place is so massive, you practically\nneed a tour guide to get around.": "",
  "This place is so massive,\nyou practically need a tour guide.": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "Therefore...": "เพราะฉะนั้น...",
  "I think I'll pass.": "คิดว่าขอผ่านดีกว่า",
  "I'll pass.": "ไม่ล่ะ",
  "I'd like to see you try.": "อยากเห็นแกลองดูอยู่เหมือนกัน",
  "No clue.": "ไม่รู้เหมือนกัน",
  "Can I help you?": "มีอะไรให้ช่วยมั้ย?",
  "Welcome, sir.": "ยินดีต้อนรับค่ะ",
  "I'll come back later.": "เดี๋ยวจะกลับมาใหม่",
  "Um, excuse me.": "เอ่อ ขอโทษนะคะ",
  "Oh?": "งั้นเหรอ?"
 }
}
